The '''Jedi Temple central security station''' was a chamber in the [[Imperial Palace|Jedi Temple]] on [[Coruscant]] which housed a beacon that was used to summon the [[Jedi]] home. It housed several towering banks that was designed for a few Jedi doing maintenance work. During the [[Clone Wars]], [[Jedi Master]] [[Obi-Wan Kenobi]] took a class of [[Padawan]]s including [[Kanan Jarrus|Caleb Dume]] on a tour of the station.<ref name="AND" />

When Caleb asked whether the beacon could be used to tell the Jedi to stay away from the Temple, Kenobi told them to await orders. Caleb's Master [[Depa Billaba]] then told him that the answer would come in a different form. During the [[Great Jedi Purge]], Kenobi used the beacon in the station to warn the Jedi to avoid Coruscant.<ref name="AND" />

